---
// src/components/ecommerce/AboutSafetyPillars.astro
import { ShieldCheck, Smile, Cloud, Layers, Droplets, Sparkle } from '@lucide/vue';
---

<section class="py-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-bilbola-surface-page via-bilbola-surface-neutralSoft/80 to-white border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 font-bilbola relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Textura de fondo sutil -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-radial from-bilbola-mint-light/20 to-transparent blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl">
    
    <!-- Encabezado con Composición Espacial -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-20 gap-8 border-b-2 border-bilbola-mint-light/40 pb-10">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-bilbola-pill bg-[#F6DFE0] text-bilbola-text-primary font-black text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 shadow-2xs">
          <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-bilbola-text-primary shrink-0" />
          <span>Tranquilidad para mamás y papás</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary tracking-tight font-bilbola leading-tight">
          Los 4 Pilares de <span class="text-bilbola-action-focus italic">Seguridad &amp; Cariño</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-bilbola-text-secondary font-medium max-w-md md:text-right leading-relaxed">
        Cada pieza es sometida a criterios de seguridad infantiles insalubres. Diseñamos juguetes y muebles pensados para durar toda una infancia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grilla Asimétrica y Dinámica (1 col plena + 3 cols o diseño escalonado) -->
    <div class="space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Pilar 1 Destacado: Rostros Bordados -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-white to-bilbola-mint-light/25 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-mint-light/60 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1 relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-48 h-48 bg-bilbola-mint-light/20 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center gap-8 relative z-10">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 shrink-0 rounded-bilbola-md bg-bilbola-mint-light border-2 border-white flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-action-focus shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3 transition-all duration-300">
            <Smile class="w-10 h-10 stroke-[2]" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex-grow space-y-3">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-extrabold text-bilbola-action-focus tracking-wider uppercase">
              <span>Pilar 01</span>
              <span>&bull;</span>
              <span>Cero Riesgos</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary font-bilbola">
              Rostros 100% Bordados a Hilo
            </h3>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-bilbola-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-3xl">
              Para evitar cualquier peligro de asfixia en bebés curiosos que exploran el mundo con su boca, nuestros peluches y muñecos tienen ojos, narices y sonrisas finamente tejidas en alto relieve artesanal, <strong class="text-bilbola-text-primary font-bold">sin botones ni piezas plásticas sueltas</strong> que puedan desprenderse al arrastre o mordisqueo.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fila de 3 Pilares en Grilla Expandida -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <!-- Pilar 2: Hipoalergénico -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-gray-light/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-[#B1C9E8]"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-bilbola-md bg-[#B1C9E8]/40 flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-text-primary mb-6 shadow-xs group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300">
              <Cloud class="w-8 h-8 stroke-[2]" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold text-bilbola-text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Pilar 02</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary mb-3 font-bilbola">
              Relleno Hipoalergénico
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-bilbola-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Utilizamos rellenos de fibra súper transpirable de <em class="not-italic font-semibold text-bilbola-text-primary">"Nubes de Algodón"</em>, diseñados explícitamente para repeler ácaros del polvo y proteger los pulmones y la piel sensible atópica.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-bilbola-text-primary font-bold">
            <Sparkle class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>Respiración limpia y pura</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilar 3: Costuras Reforzadas -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-gray-light/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-[#FAF1BA]"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-bilbola-md bg-[#FAF1BA] flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-text-primary mb-6 shadow-xs group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300">
              <Layers class="w-8 h-8 stroke-[2]" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold text-bilbola-text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Pilar 03</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary mb-3 font-bilbola">
              Costuras Doblemente Reforzadas
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-bilbola-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Sabiendo que tu hijo llevará su osito o manta por la escuela, el jardín y la plaza, todas nuestras uniones pasan por un <strong class="text-bilbola-text-primary font-semibold">doble bordado artesanal</strong> y rigurosas pruebas de tracción antidesgarros.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-bilbola-text-primary font-bold">
            <Sparkle class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-500 shrink-0" />
            <span>Resistente al abrazo fuerte</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilar 4: Lavable -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-bilbola-lg border border-bilbola-gray-light/30 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-bilbola-mint-depth"></div>
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-bilbola-md bg-bilbola-mint-light/70 flex items-center justify-center text-bilbola-action-focus mb-6 shadow-xs group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300">
              <Droplets class="w-8 h-8 stroke-[2]" />
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-extrabold text-bilbola-action-focus uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Pilar 04</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-bilbola-text-primary mb-3 font-bilbola">
              100% Lavables en Hogar
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-bilbola-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-normal">
              Porque un juguete verdaderamente amado se mancha con barro o chocolatada, garantizamos que nuestros productos resisten baños en ciclo suave de lavadora, saliendo rejuvenecidos para nuevas aventuras.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-bilbola-gray-light/20 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-bilbola-action-focus font-bold">
            <Sparkle class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-bilbola-action-focus shrink-0" />
            <span>Ciclos suaves en tu lavadora</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
